{"parse": {"title": "月兔桂花糕", "pageid": 64859, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div style=\"user-select:none; pointer-events:none; position:relative; z-index:-1;\"></div><div class=\"antique-content\"><div class=\"antique-img\"><div style=\"margin-top:-13%;\"><img alt=\"月兔桂花糕\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/9f/Antique-v2a1_antique_icon_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"月兔桂花糕\" width=\"700\" height=\"728\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"700\" data-file-height=\"728\" /></div><div style=\"position:absolute;width: 40%;height: 34%;right:20%;top: 76%;text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"Signature-antique icon 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/61/Signature-antique_icon_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"120\" data-file-height=\"120\" /></div></div><div style=\"max-width:600px; margin: 35px 20px 0 20px; text-shadow: 1px 1px 5px black;\">一碟花香馥郁的糕点，为纪念秋夜满月的赠礼。<br />赏月时，不妨摆上这碟点心，倾听一个古老悠远的传说。它关于月中玉兔，关于禳灾送吉，它作为一个节候的祝福赠送给你。<br />桂花糖浆风味浓郁，请酌量添加。<div class=\"test-hide hide-m grey-small\" style=\"float:right; margin-top:40px\">编号ID：211001</div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E6.9D.A5.E6.BA.90\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"来源\">来源</span></h2><div class=\"no-indent\" style=\"text-align:center; max-width:500px\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9C%88%E7%9A%84%E6%BB%A1%E7%9B%88\" title=\"月的满盈\"><img alt=\"月的满盈.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/%E6%9C%88%E7%9A%84%E6%BB%A1%E7%9B%88.jpg/500px-%E6%9C%88%E7%9A%84%E6%BB%A1%E7%9B%88.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/%E6%9C%88%E7%9A%84%E6%BB%A1%E7%9B%88.jpg/750px-%E6%9C%88%E7%9A%84%E6%BB%A1%E7%9B%88.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/%E6%9C%88%E7%9A%84%E6%BB%A1%E7%9B%88.jpg/1000px-%E6%9C%88%E7%9A%84%E6%BB%A1%E7%9B%88.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a><br />\n</p>\n签到活动 - <a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9C%88%E7%9A%84%E6%BB%A1%E7%9B%88\" title=\"月的满盈\">月的满盈</a></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "收藏品"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">月兔桂花糕 <small style=\"color: grey\">Moon Rabbit Rice Cake</small></span></span>"}}